  "content": "[[File:0105.png|right]] \n01.05\n\n==Laughing Sam==\n\nRegion: the Bitter Coast\n\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">Connects to: 00.06 and 29.14.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">12. </span></p>\n\n==Overview==\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">A rocky peninsula juts into the Ocean of Bitter Regrets (00.06). At its very end is a small and twisted willow leaning well over the Ocean. At its base rests a boy with a battered straw hat tugged over his eyes. This is [[Laughing Sam]].</span></p>\n[[Category:Hex]]\n[[Category:The Bitter Coast]]",
